13. A swing clicked while the last one is still playing counts (owner, 2026-10-24: now and then
    the ice pick needed two clicks; also in the original game). A finished stab wiped every
    press counted so far (button_press_num_last = button_press_num, meant to make him let go of
    the button), including one made during its animation. It wipes only the press that began the
    stab. Not reproduced by QA (the bot never clicks early): to be revert-ed if the click still
    needs repeating.
@@@ subst arm_completes_stab
stab_success = arm_stabs( ent, skipRelink );
@@@ to
ent.mw2coop_press_at_stab = ent.button_press_num;
	stab_success = arm_stabs( ent, skipRelink );
@@@ end
@@@ subst player_finishes_climbing
ent.button_press_num_last = ent.button_press_num;
@@@ to
ent.button_press_num_last = ent.mw2coop_press_at_stab;
@@@ end

14. The fall check's grace after a pause, in co-op (QA climbrec, 2026-11-26): should_fall() lets a
    climber keep hanging for 10 s after the game was last paused (GetTimeSinceLastPaused: this PC's
    own clock of pauses). The two co-op machines are paused at different moments (a failed mission's
    screen, a load), so after a restart on the wall one machine dropped the climber while the other
    kept him hanging, and the games went apart for good (the host's state hash took one more
    icepick_button_pressed() from should_fall in the first frames after the restart; the resync
    found no checkpoint before it). In co-op the time is the same on both machines
    (maps\_mw2coop_climb::time_since_paused).
@@@ subst should_fall
GetTimeSinceLastPaused()
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop_climb::time_since_paused()
@@@ end

15. The jump's arms (player_arms: the first-person arms the jumper hangs from until Soap's catch)
    are the jumper's own view; the game shows them to everyone, and on the second wall, where both
    players hang and start climbing at the same spot, the partner had them in his face ("mantis
    arms", owner, 2026-11-26). They are hidden from the partner, who sees the jumper's body.
@@@ subst player_big_jump
player_arms Show();
@@@ to
player_arms maps\_mw2coop_climb::rig_show( self );
@@@ end
